_em_specimen.concentration           0.928 
_em_specimen.details                 
;CRF01_AE T/F100 SOSIP (GnT1- produced) was incubated with 15-fold excess of ANC195 Fab and 10-1074 Fab overnight at 4 degrees Celsius before purification on a Superose 6 300/10 GL column (GE Healthcare). The complex peak was harvested, concentrated to 0.8-1.0 mg/mL in PBS buffer, and immediately used for CryoEM grid preparation.
